{"3708150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Trackline", "steam_appid": 3708150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rhythm-based action game about a Walkman wielding rebel, fighting their way out of the expansive urban underground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the speed of battle by swapping between fast, medium, and slow cassette tapes to change the tempo of yourself and the entire world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time your attacks along with the environment, causing toxic water, fans and trains to speed up as the music does! Jump between platforms and dodge hazards, then strike your enemies at the right time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rhythm-powered combat, synchronized to cassette tape tempos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Three tempo modes (Fast, Medium, Slow) that change enemy speed and attack timing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Tempo-reponsive environments, including poison floods, industrial fans, and moving trains </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 3D platforming challenges across multiple handcrafted stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-  Roughly 30 minutes of gameplay per complete run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A pulsing soundtrack that drives both combat and platform action</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rhythm-based action game about a Walkman wielding rebel, fighting their way out of the expansive urban underground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the speed of battle by swapping between fast, medium, and slow cassette tapes to change the tempo of yourself and the entire world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time your attacks along with the environment, causing toxic water, fans and trains to speed up as the music does! Jump between platforms and dodge hazards, then strike your enemies at the right time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rhythm-pow